msgctxt "80"
msgid "Ugh... I thought you were fresh outta prison..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry I disgraced our boss, but I did my time. My duties as a yakuza are"
" over, once and for all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "It's just that easy, huh? Well, that's not enough for what you did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"If you're not gonna leave this city alive, then we'll make sure you leave it"
" dead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"When I was in the yakuza fifteen years ago, there was a big war goin' on "
"just outside the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I was a big name in the business back then. Had to lead a lot of boys into "
"battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "And then one day, my son was abducted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "That day, I abandoned my duty to save my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Our family ultimately won the war, but we lost a lot of boys out there. All "
"'cause I wasn't there to lead 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I took responsibility for the war and turned myself in, but the boss cut me "
"off from the family while I was in prison."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Only natural, I guess. I disgraced the boss and got my brothers killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "There's one more place I'd like to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Could you take me to West Park? The homeless gather there. Pretty sure it's "
"to the north."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "This is Shangri-La? Where's the brothel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "They shut down about four years ago. There was a lot going on here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"I heard in the joint that some asshole crashed a dump truck into the "
"place... Looks like it's true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"What's the point of havin' a nice building if you can't have any fun in it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I heard Shangri-La had the best brothel in Kamurocho, too. What a "
"disappointment..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Hm. Well... sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "I thought you might show up here, you horny son of a bitch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Too bad Shangri-La's moved on without you, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"I'm outta the business now. I went to the joint and washed my hands of "
"everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "These guys have been after you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Yeah... Some stuff happened before I went to prison..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Tell me about it afterwards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Snuff out both of these bastards!"
msgstr ""

